<tr><td style="padding:0 0 12px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse:separate"><tr><td class="hm-warn" style="padding:10px 14px;background-color:#fff3d1;border:1px solid #e8c977;border-radius:10px;color:#7a4f00;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:700">[SANDBOX] Not production: this email is from Hana ID sandbox-test (testnet), for testing.</td></tr></table></td></tr>
