<tr><td class="hm-pad" style="padding:30px 32px 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#16073a;word-break:break-word;overflow-wrap:anywhere"><h1 class="hm-ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:700;color:#16073a">You&#39;re invited to Sodax Labs on Hana ID</h1><p class="hm-ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#16073a">You have been invited to join Sodax Labs (org_1) in the Hana ID partner console as an owner, by an owner of the organisation.</p><p class="hm-ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#16073a">Accepting adds you to the organisation. Owners change apps, keys and members; if it already has an owner, you are a viewer (who sees everything and changes nothing) until a waiting period ends, and its owners are told and can cancel it.</p><p class="hm-ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#16073a">Sign in with the Google account of this address. The invitation expires on 2026-11-17T09:00:00Z.</p><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:4px 0 0;border-collapse:separate"><tr><td class="hm-btn" align="center" bgcolor="#3308a8" style="border-radius:999px;background-color:#3308a8"><a class="hm-btn-a" href="https://console.test/invite#t=abc_DEF-123" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="display:inline-block;padding:13px 26px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:999px">Accept the invitation</a></td></tr></table><p class="hm-muted" style="margin:12px 0 20px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#665d80">Or copy this address into your browser:<br><span class="hm-host hm-ink2" style="font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono','Courier New',monospace;font-size:12px;color:#4c3d7f;word-break:break-all">https:<span>/</span><wbr><span>/</span><wbr>console<span>.</span><wbr>test<span>/</span><wbr>invite<span>#</span><wbr>t<span>=</span><wbr>abc_DEF-123</span></p><p class="hm-ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#16073a">The link works once, for this address only. If you were not expecting this, ignore this email.</p></td></tr>
</table></td></tr>
<tr><td class="hm-muted" style="padding:16px 8px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#665d80">Sent by Hana ID security. Hana never asks you to approve anything from an email. To reach Hana security, reply to this address or write to your Hana contact.</td></tr>
