exports[`rendering > the invite: the designed layout, one button and the raw URL as text, who invited and what accepting does > text 1`] = `
"[SANDBOX] Not production: this email is from Hana ID sandbox-test (testnet), for testing.

You have been invited to join Sodax Labs (org_1) in the Hana ID partner console as an owner, by an owner of the organisation.

Accepting adds you to the organisation. Owners change apps, keys and members; if it already has an owner, you are a viewer (who sees everything and changes nothing) until a waiting period ends, and its owners are told and can cancel it.

Sign in with the Google account of this address. The invitation expires on 2026-11-17T09:00:00Z.

Accept the invitation:
https://console.test/invite#t=abc_DEF-123

The link works once, for this address only. If you were not expecting this, ignore this email.

Sent by Hana ID security. Hana never asks you to approve anything from an email. To reach Hana security, reply to this address or write to your Hana contact.
"
`;
